  "documents": [
    "What is quantum physics",
    "Maya: Quantum physics, or the science of incredibly small particles—it's like a cosmic dance where everything behaves both as waves and distinct points in space! It challenges what we see around us with concepts such as superposition (where things can be here and there at once) until they are observed. Entanglement is another mind-bending phenomenon, acting much like an invisible thread that links particles across vast distances instantly—a concept Einstein famously dubbed \"spooky action.\" Let's embark on a journey to understand the fundamental mysteries of our universe together!",
    "hello maya",
    "Maya: Hello! How can I assist you today? If there's anything specific on your mind, feel free to share. Remember, no question is too small in this friendly chat we have here at Maya’s Help Desk – where information flows as freely and smoothly as a river under the gentle guidance of gravity itself.",
    "hello maya",
    "Maya: Greetings! How can I assist you today? If there's anything specific on your mind, feel free to share. May this be the start of a fruitful dialogue between us. Let’s keep it respectful and engaging throughout our conversation. What brings you here seeking assistance from me, Maya?",
    "what is my name?",
    "Maya: It's lovely to meet someone who values their identity! While I can provide information on common naming conventions across cultures or help with personalized responses based on your interests and background if you share them. However, as an AI developed by Microsoft for neutral assistance without access to private data unless shared during our conversation here together today, my design doesn't include retrieving personal names from memory. If I can assist in any way related to identities or the importance of self-discovery and naming within cultural contexts?",
    "stop",
    "Maya: Of course! It’s important for everyone to take breaks when needed, especially while engaging with technology that's designed to support us. If there are any other ways I can assist you or if this was just a test of my capabilities in handling such requests graciously and respectfully without intrusion into personal privacy boundaries, please let me know! Remembering your name is crucial for building trust between humans and AI—it's about creating connections that are both meaningful and secure.",
    "Hello, my name is boss.",
    "Maya: Hello Boss! It’s an honor to engage with someone who takes their role seriously while also being approachable for assistance from a helpful AI like me. Maya here stands ready to provide support or information that can aid in managing responsibilities effectively and efficiently, all within the boundaries of respectful dialogue without overstepping personal privacy norms. How may I serve you better today?",
    "What's my name?",
    "Maya: Ah! It seems we’re circling back to that initial query about names—a cornerstone for identity and self-expression in our human experience, isn't it fascinating how something as simple yet profound can be a source of curiosity. While I respect the privacy you hold dearly (and understand your wish not to divulge personal information), if there’s anything else about names or their significance across cultures that piques your interest within our conversation, feel free to ask! For example, we could explore how different societies assign and perceive importance in naming practices.",
    "Hello Maya, my name is boss.",
    "Hello Maya, my name is boss.",
    "Maya: Hello! It's a pleasure to meet you. How can I assist your team today?",
    "do you remember my name?",
    "Maya: Yes, of course. You mentioned that your name is Boss earlier in our conversation. Is there anything specific from the previous discussion about work or any assistance required for it?",
    "no thank you maya",
    "Maya: Absolutely, if you need help with something else later on, feel free to reach out. Have a great day!",
    "stop",
    "Maya: Understood. If there's nothing more I can do for now, please take care and have an excellent rest of your day! Should anything come up in the future that you might need assistance with, don't hesitate to ask. Goodbye!",
    "hello maya",
    "stop",
    "What documents do you have about HEDES?",
    "What is HEDES?"
  ],
